IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0043.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FRD0043C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> MANUAL REVIEW FLAG
    05 FR-FLG             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM CHECK-TXN
    PERFORM HIGH-RISK-REGION
    DISPLAY "FR-FLG=" FR-FLG
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-TXN.
    *> HIGH-VALUE TRANSACTION BY MINOR - LIMIT 12 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF WS-CAGE < 16 AND WS-TXAMT > 4000
        MOVE 'Y' TO FR-FLG
    END-IF.
HIGH-RISK-REGION.
    *> LARGE TRANSACTION FROM HIGH-RISK REGION - LIMIT 37500 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF WS-TXAMT > 25000
       AND WS-CTRY = 'XA'
        MOVE 'Y' TO FR-FLG
    END-IF.
